+---
+claim_id: native_correlated_ward_certificates_note_2026-09-10
+claim_type: bounded_theorem
+claim_scope: "Under the supplied native Gaussian model, common h/4 channel gap and Ward identity: sharp norm-only quadratic remainder, a fixed zero-dual certificate exclusion, and reduced signed-dual intervals that remain inconclusive."
+upstream_dependencies:
